 "_insightComment": "Fields feeding the Smart Insights hover card (generateOrderInsights in OrderTable.jsx). Live these are computed from the dispatch/delivery/return records themselves; the seed carries the derived figures directly since those record sets are a later phase.",
 "_methodTotalsComment": "Live this bar renders only when the API returns methodTotals. The reference screenshot shows none, so it is empty here and the bar does not render.",
 "_expandComment": "Fields feeding OrderFulfillmentMetadata, the panel that opens when a row is expanded. It has four tabs -- Details, Items (n), Comments, Fulfillment. Live the dispatch/delivery/return records are fetched per order; the seed carries them inline.",
